the Saveable is a contract.
this allows Saved.

the Game is an actor.
this can Inner.
this's Inner does...
    that is Saveable.
    this is Saved with "data"!

this can Outer.
this's Outer does...
    do this's Inner.
    this is that!

the App is a script.

do Game's Outer...
    when that is Saved?
        log "got saved".
        log that's result.
    or?
        log "other".
